{
  "name": "Save new YouTube videos to Google Drive with Importly",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Save new YouTube videos to Google Drive\nEvery new upload on a channel lands in a Drive folder as a video (or audio) file. Works on n8n Cloud and on servers where YouTube blocks downloads.\n\n### Setup\n1. Get an Importly API key at https://www.importly.io/dashboard/api-key?utm_source=n8n&utm_medium=template&utm_campaign=guerrilla-2026-11 (free to try, no card required).\n2. In the **Importly** node, create an **Importly API** credential and paste the key.\n3. In **New video on channel**, replace `CHANNEL_ID` with the channel's ID (the `UC...` part of its URL).\n4. In **Upload to Google Drive**, connect Google Drive and pick a folder.\n\nAny link works the same way: TikTok, Instagram, X, podcasts and 1,000+ other sites.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "98d4d985-e93a-4f5e-af31-c121115e23ff",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Change what gets saved\nOpen **Download the video** > Options:\n- **Format**: Audio Only for podcasts or music\n- **Video Quality**: 720p by default\n- **Max Cost (USD)**: caps each download (about $0.002 per MB)",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "05587822-89b5-4893-bc10-5f2d180ad10b",
      "name": "Options",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        600,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyHour"
            }
          ]
        },
        "feedUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/feeds/videos.xml?channel_id=CHANNEL_ID"
      },
      "id": "1c8825fc-dd6d-43b5-85f3-fc802b3fe54b",
      "name": "New video on channel",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.rssFeedReadTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "media",
        "operation": "import",
        "url": "={{ $json.link }}",
        "waitForCompletion": true,
        "downloadFile": true,
        "binaryPropertyName": "data",
        "options": {
          "videoQuality": "720p",
          "maxCostDollars": 1
        }
      },
      "id": "4f632a53-9fe6-4963-853b-1f7263b094de",
      "name": "Download the video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-importly.importly",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        300,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "name": "={{ $json.filename }}",
        "driveId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "My Drive"
        },
        "folderId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "root",
          "cachedResultName": "/ (Root folder)"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "ad61bcf8-e87d-4237-8997-1906684017ee",
      "name": "Upload to Google Drive",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        620,
        200
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "New video on channel": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Download the video",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Download the video": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Upload to Google Drive",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  },
  "tags": []
}
